-- statement:
--   Sixty literal states `RHX1000000.Run.E71.S1` … `S60` of the framework's offline Euler–Maclaurin evaluator (`ArbEcon.Off.StO`): the claimed states after every 5000 steps of the run at the centre of edge piece 71 at height $10^6$. They are not trusted; the problems `RHX1000000.Run.E71.blk0` … `blk9` prove that the run passes through them.
